{"title": "Conjure Elemental: Fire Elemental", "pageid": 14281, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Conjure_Elemental:_Fire_Elemental", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 5 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about a specific variant of Conjure Elemental. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Conjure Elemental (disambiguation)\">Conjure Elemental (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp/300px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp, /w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp/300px-Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Elemental_Fire_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Conjure Elemental: Fire Elemental</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 5 conjuration spell</a>. This spell is a variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\">Conjure Elemental</a> that allows spellcasters to summon a <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Elemental\" title=\"Fire Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nThe fire elemental can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Smouldering_Touch\" title=\"Smouldering Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/38px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/50px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Smouldering Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Smouldering_Touch\" title=\"Smouldering Touch\">Smouldering Touch</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Erupting_Cinder\" title=\"Erupting Cinder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/25px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/38px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/50px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Erupting Cinder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/25px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Erupting_Cinder\" title=\"Erupting Cinder\">Erupting Cinder</a>, and can make your foes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burn</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 5 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-place