th=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>11</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>17</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>16</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>6</span></b></div> <span>(-2)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b></div> \n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">CHA</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>7</span></b>\n<b></b></div><b> <span>(-2)</span></b>\n</td>\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/36px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/48px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Duration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Until long rest</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>102</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>13</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Tiny</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Smouldering_Touch\" title=\"Smouldering Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/40px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/60px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/80px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Smouldering Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp/40px-Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Smouldering_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Smouldering_Touch\" title=\"Smouldering Touch\">Smouldering Touch</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Touch a foe with a heat like the bright core of a furnace, searing and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a></span> them. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Fire_Elemental)\" title=\"Multiattack (Fire Elemental)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp/60px-Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp/80px-Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Multiattack_Fire_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Fire_Elemental)\" title=\"Multiattack (Fire Elemental)\">Multiattack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Descend on a creature to scorch it with a multitude of primordial flames. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Erupting_Cinder\" title=\"Erupting Cinder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/40px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/60px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/80px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Erupting Cinder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp/40px-Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Erupting_Cinder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Erupting_Cinder\" title=\"Erupting Cinder\">Erupting Cinder</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Stoke a giant cinderball and lob it, bursting in wide explosion and creating a fiery surface. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Warp\" title=\"Elemental Warp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Warp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Warp\" title=\"Elemental Warp\">Elemental Warp</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Surrounded by silver mist, you teleport to an unoccupied space you can see. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\">Conjure Elemental</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Fire Elementals do not have <a href=\"/wiki/Flight\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flight\">Flight</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a>. This can result in them being left behind if your party jumps gaps or cliffs; you will need to manually have them use <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Warp\" title=\"Elemental Warp\">Elemental Warp</a> regularly to have them stay with your party.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Portrait_Fire_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Portrait\"><picture><img alt=\"Portrait\" src=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Fire_Elemental.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Portrait_Fire_Elemental.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Portrait</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Conjure_elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRW